infographic sequence-ascending-steps
data
  title The tenant-isolation escalation ladder
  desc One per-tenant load threshold per rung — the policy decides, so no engineer judges under 3am pressure
  order asc
  sequences
    - label Above 5% of cluster load — auto-isolate
      desc A background job invokes isolate_tenant_to_new_shard. Online, sub-second write pause, no human required for routine cases.
    - label Above 20% — dedicated worker
      desc One tenant now rivals a fifth of the cluster. Move their isolated shard onto a worker of its own so they no longer contend.
    - label Above 50% — dedicated cluster
      desc The tenant dominates. Give them their own cluster and start a capacity-and-pricing conversation with the account.
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
